import Erdos74.Resolutions.Erdos74_118usd_22h

/-!
# Erdős problem #74: disproof

Library root. It imports the primary resolution `Erdos74.Resolutions.Erdos74_118usd_22h`, the file
produced in the FrontierMath Erdős benchmark, which proves `Erdos74.erdos_74.disproof`.

The further resolutions in `Erdos74/Resolutions/` (`Erdos74_25usd_5h`, `Erdos74_46usd_6h`, `Erdos74_81usd_13h`, `Erdos74_99usd_17h`, `Erdos74_146usd_19h`) are
independent proofs of the same statement. Each is a self-contained copy of the benchmark
statement preamble followed by its own proof, so they are built as the separate library
`Erdos74Alternates` and deliberately not imported here.
-/
